---

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/baseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/event.css" ;
import "../styles/global.css" ;

import Image from 'astro/components/Image.astro';
const YJP1 = "../public/branding/long-logo-orange-lug-2000x550px.svg"

const BASE_URL = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---


<BaseLayout>
<section class="about-section">
<!-- consider sub-grids for this page -->
    <div class="about-head">  
        <h1 class="about-title full-span">About the brand </h1>
        <span class="full-span"><img src={YJP1} alt="Your Jam Plug UK" class="about-brand-logo">
        </span>
    </div>
    <!-- might replace with logo image -->
    <div class="about-welcome block">
        <p class="open-statement">Your Jam Plug UK was founded by a London skater who wanted people to miss out less.</p>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    <div class="about-mission block">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width mission-title">The Mission</h2>
        <p class="mission-statement">To build up the world of roller skating, keep the rinks alive and the communities connected</p>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
    <div class="about-founder block">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width founder-title">The Founder</h2>
        
        <div class="port founder-image">
            <Image src="/src/assets/Skater.Shynell.JPG" alt="Me" height={320} width={260}  />
            <span>taken by Daniel Bridle</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-me">
            <p>Started skating in London, UK back in 2018...</p>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Cum dignissimos, perferendis minima nostrum tempora doloribus facere illum voluptatem maiores eligendi animi in rem deleniti error ut repudiandae reprehenderit repellat at.</p>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Cum dignissimos, perferendis minima nostrum tempora doloribus facere illum voluptatem maiores eligendi animi in rem deleniti error ut repudiandae reprehenderit repellat at.</p>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Cum dignissimos, perferendis minima nostrum tempora doloribus facere illum voluptatem maiores eligendi animi in rem deleniti error ut repudiandae reprehenderit repellat at.</p>
            
        </div>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
    <div class="about-process">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width full-span block">The Process</h2>
        
        <p>Anyone can submit an event, we'll add it to the website</p>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Reiciendis minima quasi nulla minus, recusandae rem dolor totam consequuntur ab beatae quia cum, non tempore molestias exercitationem voluptatem eligendi est assumenda?</p>
        <p>skaters can help by supporting this brand</p>
    </div>    
    
    <div class="about-process-graphic block">
        <div class="heading-full-width port process-graphic"></div>
    </div>
    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    <div class="about-support block">
        <h3 class="heading-small">How you can support</h3>
        <p>engage and share</p>
        <p>this page stays alive with the support of the community. At the moment i'm a one-woman-band BUT the aim is to grow!</p>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Perferendis porro aliquid architecto corporis debitis est eaque. Consequatur molestiae facilis saepe consequuntur? In id magnam reprehenderit voluptate, quam officiis blanditiis itaque.</p>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>

    .heading-full-width {
        width: 100%;
        height: max-content;

        line-height: 3ch;
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-mid);
        padding-left: .5rem;
        margin: .5rem 1rem;

    }

    .heading-small {
        width: 100%;
        font-size: var(--fs-p2);
        justify-self: center;
    }

    .about-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        margin-top: 4rem;

    }

    .block {
        margin-block: 1.8rem;
        padding-inline: .5rem;
    }

    .separation {
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-xl);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--box-teal);
    }

    .about-head {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .about-title {
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-xl);
        margin: .3ch;
        text-align: center;
    }
    
    .about-brand-logo {
        width: 100px;
        height: max-content;
        justify-items: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .about-welcome {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .about-welcome .open-statement {
        padding-inline: 10vw;
        font-size: var(--fs-p2);
        text-align: center;

    }

    .about-mission {
        padding: .2rem;
    }

    .about-mission .mission-title {
        text-align: right;
        justify-self: end;
        padding-right: 3rem;
    }
    .about-mission .mission-statement {
        text-align: right;
        justify-self: end;
        width: 55ch;
        padding-right: 1rem;
    }

    .about-founder {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 30px 25% 20% 30px 20% 25% 30px;
        grid-template-rows: repeat(auto ) 3;

    }

    @media (max-width: 749px) {
        .about-founder {
            display:flex;
            flex-direction: column;

            align-items: center;
            justify-items: center;
        }

        .founder-title {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .founder-image {
            margin-block: 1rem;
        }

        .about-me {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        
    }

    .founder-title {
        grid-row: 1 ;
        grid-column: 1 / 5;
    }

    .founder-image {

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;

        height: 320px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        grid-row: 2;
        grid-column-end: 7;
        justify-self: end;
        
    }

    .about-me {
        grid-row: 2 /4;
        grid-column: 2 / 5;

        text-wrap: balance;

    }

    .about-process {
        text-align: center;
        justify-items: center;
        align-self: center;
        width: 80ch;
    }
    
    .about-process-graphic {
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .process-graphic {
        width: 80%;
        justify-self: center;
        height: 210px;

        background-color: var(--main-orange);
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .about-support {
        /* margin-inline: 5rem; */
        /* margin-block: 3rem; */
        width: 65ch;
        align-self: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

</style>